{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49465","headline":"遐方怨 · 顾敻","name":"遐方怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帘影细，簟文平。\n象纱笼玉指，缕金罗扇轻。\n嫩红双脸似花明，两条眉黛远山横。\n凤箫歇，镜尘生。\n辽塞音书绝，梦魂长暗惊。\n玉郎经岁负娉婷，教人争不恨无情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49465.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49465","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}